        "parse_type.title": "Parse type",
        "summary": "<xdoc><p>The Parse Path tool parses the input into its file, path, name, or extension. The output can be used as inline variable in the output name of other tools.</p><note type=\"legacy\"/><p group=\"note\">This is a deprecated tool. This functionality has been replaced by the new Parse Path tool.</p></xdoc>",
